{"product_id":"ember-reserve-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Burl wood points x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, the forearm showcases striking \u003cstrong\u003eburl wood long points\u003c\/strong\u003e framed by elegant \u003cstrong\u003eebony accents\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a bold yet sophisticated design. A deep \u003cstrong\u003ecrimson resin coating\u003c\/strong\u003e enhances the natural beauty of the wood with exceptional depth and a mirror-like finish. Complementing the design is a \u003cstrong\u003epremium Brown Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e, offering a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip, while the \u003cstrong\u003ecrimson resin butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, accented with a \u003cstrong\u003eburl wood ring\u003c\/strong\u003e, completes the cue with warmth and refined character.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Ember Reserve embodies the precision, balance, and artistry that define every Elite Cue creation. Every detail is thoughtfully crafted to deliver exceptional performance while celebrating the natural beauty of premium woods and the brilliance of handcrafted resin artistry. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, this cue is built to leave a lasting impression.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Burl Wood Long Points \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCoating:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin Coated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Brown Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin with Burl Wood Accent Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarm elegance. Timeless craftsmanship. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453553934384,"sku":null,"price":17000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/093b11c4-7765-4454-82ce-9db4338da305.png?v=1785661054","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/ember-reserve-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}